# openHC feature: sgx — the PowerVR SGX545 KERNEL driver for the CE5300 GPU (PCI
# 01:02.0, 8086:089b), ported from Intel's Cedarview GPL DDK 1.7.
#
# There are NO Buildroot packages here. The driver is in-tree — a submodule at
# board/ea/common/kernel/drivers/gpu/drm/sgx545ce, mirrored into the kernel and
# built as a module via CONFIG_SGX545_CE=m (see linux.fragment + objs.mk). It
# gives /dev/dri/card0; that is all the kernel half does.
#
# The proprietary GLES userspace blobs + WPE WebKit (what actually draws on the
# HDMI display) are the SEPARATE `wpe` feature, enabled fleet-EA alongside this.
